      "title": "epan: Report bugs for unsupported FT_STRINGZ encodings",
      "message": "epan: Report bugs for unsupported FT_STRINGZ encodings\n\nAdd some DISSECTOR_BUGs for unsupported FT_STRINGZ encodings instead\nof silently treating them as ASCII.\n\nMove the bit that calculates the length of a UCS-4 string out of that\nfunction into a static function in preparation for using it somewhere\nelse.\n",
